=The student has provided the following request:
name - {{ $json.Name }}
subjects/topics - {{ $json["What subjects/topics do you need to study?"] }}
exam date - {{ $json["Exam Date"] }}
hours - {{ $json["How many hours can you study per day?"] }}
current lvl - {{ $json["Current level"] }}
weak topics -{{ $json["Weak Topics"] }}
completed topics- {{ $json["Which topics have you already completed?"] }}
preference - {{ $json["Study Preference"] }}

Use the available tools and information to understand the request and help the student.

If the student wants to create a study plan, create a realistic plan based on their requirements.

If the student wants to reschedule a study session, identify the relevant existing session and make the requested change.

Return a clear and concise response that the student can directly understand and act upon.
